# Paths TruffleHog skips. One regex per line, matched against the file path.
#
# uv lockfiles hold nothing but package names, versions, registry URLs and
# public sha256 checksums — there is no field in them a credential could live
# in. Checksums are 64 hex characters, so one occasionally matches a token
# pattern by coincidence: sentry_sdk 2.68.0's sdist hash trips the SentryToken
# detector, which would otherwise block every commit that re-locks a project.
#
# Excluding the paths rather than the detector keeps SentryToken (and every
# other detector) live everywhere a real credential could actually appear.
uv\.lock$
